sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Person as Founder / lawyer
  participant UI as Browser
  participant API as Next.js API
  participant DB as Atlas
  participant W as Vercel Workflow
  participant AI as OpenAI Responses
  Person->>UI: Register company event
  UI->>API: Session + CSRF + idempotent command
  API->>DB: Save event and queued workflow
  API->>W: Schedule with ownership ticket
  API-->>UI: Event and workflow IDs
  W->>DB: Claim step, pin facts, policy, harness
  Note over W: Load bundled legal catalog, check readiness<br/>Deterministic supported-scope assessment
  alt Missing facts, untrusted source or unsupported scope
    W->>DB: Persist needs_information / needs_human_review
  else Draft required
    loop Bounded model tool loop
      W->>DB: Reserve workspace and global budget
      W->>AI: Pinned input + tools + strict schema
      AI-->>W: Function calls or structured proposal
      Note over W: Execute scoped tools, return results to model
      W->>DB: Settle usage, retain provider and tool receipts
    end
    Note over W: Check structure, facts, citations and preservation
    W->>DB: Retain deterministically valid candidate as unaccepted
    W->>AI: Separate review with full authority text
    AI-->>W: Verdict + operational requirements
    alt Repairable failure and allowance remains
      Note over W,AI: At most two repairs, fully check every new candidate
    else Failure, exhausted limit or uncertain charge
      W->>DB: Preserve candidate and reason, pause
    else All checks pass
      W->>DB: Seal exact packet, awaiting_founder
      UI->>API: Poll scoped workflow state
      API->>DB: Read saved state
      API-->>UI: Status, redline and receipts
      Person->>UI: Founder approves current packet
      UI->>API: Role + bundle hash + versions
      API->>DB: Check guards, awaiting_lawyer, queue preview
      Person->>UI: Lawyer approves same packet
      UI->>API: Role + same bundle hash + versions
      API->>DB: Recheck, advance current revision, document.finalized
      Note over API,DB: Internal finalization, preview email only in public demo
    end
  end
  opt Eligible failure or attributed feedback
    W->>DB: Deduplicated improvement trigger
    Note over W,AI: Separate proposal and six paired trials,<br/>promotion affects later events only if every gate passes
  end
